{"id":"vd-b1-the-flat-share","level":"b1","n":19,"title":{"en":"Can We Agree on That?","vi":"Mình thống nhất thế nhé?"},"summary":"Buổi họp nhà quanh bàn bếp: Kwame điều phối, Jade và Tomasz lần lượt đưa ra đề nghị và nhượng bộ để cả bốn cùng sống yên ổn.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-b1-the-flat-share","level":"b1","title":{"en":"The Flat Share","vi":"Căn hộ ở ghép"}},"scene":{"background":"kitchen","props":[{"id":"tea","x":800},{"id":"notebook","x":1010,"y":640,"scale":0.8}]},"cast":{"kwame":{"name":{"en":"Kwame","vi":"Kwame"},"look":"man","x":300,"style":{"hair":"short","hairColor":"#1A1A1A","skin":"#6E4127","skinShade":"#58321D","outfit":"tee","top":"#C9A227","topShade":"#AE8B1F"}},"jade":{"name":{"en":"Jade","vi":"Jade"},"look":"woman","x":800,"style":{"hair":"long","hairColor":"#C8963E","outfit":"blouse","top":"#D6608B","topShade":"#BD4F77"}},"tomasz":{"name":{"en":"Tomasz","vi":"Tomasz"},"look":"teenboy","x":1300,"style":{"hair":"fringe","hairColor":"#8B6B4A","outfit":"jacket","top":"#4A5D7E","topShade":"#3C4D69"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"kwame","en":"OK, everyone. No shouting tonight. Let's get rid of all this tension.","vi":"Được rồi, mọi người. Tối nay không ai la hét. Mình dẹp hết căng thẳng đi.","ipa":["oʊˈkeɪ","ˈɛvɹiˌwʌn","noʊ","ˈʃaʊtɪŋ","təˈnaɪt","lɛts","ɡɛt","ɹɪd","ʌv","ɔl","ðɪs","ˈtɛnʃən"],"start":0.554,"end":4.774,"gesture":"explain","prop":"tea","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,0.971],[2,1.895],[3,2.065],[4,2.429],[5,3.276],[6,3.445],[7,3.666],[8,3.835],[9,3.953],[10,4.161],[11,4.343]]},{"speaker":"jade","en":"This is a bit awkward, but can I start? It's about the dishes.","vi":"Hơi ngại, nhưng tớ nói trước nhé? Chuyện bát đĩa.","ipa":["ðɪs","ɪz","ə","bɪt","ˈɑkwɚd","bʌt","kæn","aɪ","stɑɹt","ɪts","əˈbaʊt","ðə","ˈdɪʃəz"],"start":5.564,"end":9.284,"expression":"shy","timing":[[0,5.564],[1,5.72],[2,5.851],[3,5.942],[4,6.137],[5,6.619],[6,6.788],[7,6.984],[8,7.075],[9,8.012],[10,8.155],[11,8.48],[12,8.611]]},{"speaker":"kwame","en":"Go ahead.","vi":"Cậu nói đi.","ipa":["ɡoʊ","əˈhɛd"],"start":10.074,"end":10.564,"gesture":"nod","timing":[[0,10.074],[1,10.188]]},{"speaker":"jade","en":"I know I leave them. I'm sorry. What if we had a cleaning rota?","vi":"Tớ biết tớ hay bỏ bát đĩa lại. Tớ xin lỗi. Hay là mình lập bảng phân công dọn dẹp?","ipa":["aɪ","noʊ","aɪ","liv","ðɛm","aɪm","ˈsɑɹi","wʌt","ɪf","wi","hæd","ə","ˈklinɪŋ","ˈɹoʊtə"],"start":11.354,"end":15.534,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,11.354],[1,11.377],[2,11.586],[3,11.69],[4,12.002],[5,12.757],[6,12.914],[7,13.851],[8,14.007],[9,14.19],[10,14.32],[11,14.502],[12,14.58],[13,15.062]]},{"speaker":"tomasz","en":"That sounds fair. One week each for the kitchen.","vi":"Nghe công bằng đấy. Mỗi người một tuần lo bếp.","ipa":["ðæt","saʊndz","fɛɹ","wʌn","wik","itʃ","fɔɹ","ðə","ˈkɪtʃən"],"start":16.324,"end":19.984,"gesture":"nod","timing":[[0,16.324],[1,16.52],[2,16.91],[3,18.292],[4,18.644],[5,18.93],[6,19.217],[7,19.36],[8,19.464]]},{"speaker":"kwame","en":"Good. And the noise at night?","vi":"Tốt. Còn chuyện ồn ào ban đêm?","ipa":["ɡʊd","ənd","ðə","nɔɪz","æt","naɪt"],"start":20.774,"end":22.384,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,20.774],[1,21.428],[2,21.506],[3,21.598],[4,21.91],[5,22.014]]},{"speaker":"tomasz","en":"That's me, I know. Would you mind if I played until midnight on Fridays?","vi":"Là tớ, tớ biết. Các cậu có phiền không nếu tớ chơi đến nửa đêm vào tối thứ Sáu?","ipa":["ðæts","mi","aɪ","noʊ","wʊd","ju","maɪnd","ɪf","aɪ","pleɪd","ənˈtɪl","ˈmɪdˌnaɪt","ɑn","ˈfɹaɪdiz"],"start":23.174,"end":28.074,"expression":"shy","timing":[[0,23.174],[1,23.461],[2,23.851],[3,23.942],[4,25.286],[5,25.481],[6,25.585],[7,25.937],[8,26.041],[9,26.132],[10,26.484],[11,26.783],[12,27.252],[13,27.395]]},{"speaker":"jade","en":"Only on Fridays? I can live with that.","vi":"Chỉ tối thứ Sáu thôi à? Tớ chấp nhận được.","ipa":["ˈoʊnli","ɑn","ˈfɹaɪdiz","aɪ","kæn","lɪv","wɪð","ðæt"],"start":28.864,"end":31.544,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,28.864],[1,29.109],[2,29.278],[3,30.437],[4,30.515],[5,30.723],[6,30.971],[7,31.14]]},{"speaker":"kwame","en":"And with headphones on, please.","vi":"Và nhớ đeo tai nghe nhé.","ipa":["ənd","wɪð","ˈhɛdˌfoʊnz","ɑn","pliz"],"start":32.334,"end":34.054,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,32.334],[1,32.412],[2,32.569],[3,33.05],[4,33.519]]},{"speaker":"tomasz","en":"No problem. Headphones every night. I promise.","vi":"Không vấn đề gì. Đêm nào tớ cũng đeo tai nghe. Tớ hứa.","ipa":["noʊ","ˈpɹɑbləm","ˈhɛdˌfoʊnz","ˈɛvɚi","naɪt","aɪ","ˈpɹɑməs"],"start":34.844,"end":39.824,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,34.844],[1,35.016],[2,36.542],[3,37.284],[4,37.558],[5,38.912],[6,39.081]]},{"speaker":"jade","en":"Kwame, what about your trumpet?","vi":"Kwame, thế còn cây kèn trumpet của cậu?","ipa":["","wʌt","əˈbaʊt","jɔɹ","ˈtɹʌmpət"],"start":40.614,"end":42.584,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,40.614],[1,41.369],[2,41.539],[3,41.825],[4,41.955]]},{"speaker":"kwame","en":"How about if I practice at the university in the afternoons?","vi":"Hay là chiều nào tớ cũng tập ở trường nhé?","ipa":["haʊ","əˈbaʊt","ɪf","aɪ","ˈpɹæktəs","æt","ðə","ˌjunəˈvɝsəti","ɪn","ðə","ˌæftɚˈnunz"],"start":43.374,"end":46.414,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,43.374],[1,43.481],[2,43.716],[3,43.833],[4,43.924],[5,44.497],[6,44.588],[7,44.666],[8,45.395],[9,45.487],[10,45.591]]},{"speaker":"jade","en":"Really? You'd do that?","vi":"Thật à? Cậu chịu làm vậy sao?","ipa":["ˈɹɪli","jud","du","ðæt"],"start":47.204,"end":48.794,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,47.204],[1,48.019],[2,48.227],[3,48.409]]},{"speaker":"kwame","en":"Of course. It's a compromise. We all give a little.","vi":"Tất nhiên. Đó là thoả hiệp mà. Ai cũng nhường một chút.","ipa":["ʌv","kɔɹs","ɪts","ə","ˈkɑmpɹəˌmaɪz","wi","ɔl","ɡɪv","ə","ˈlɪtəl"],"start":49.584,"end":52.724,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,49.584],[1,49.662],[2,50.548],[3,50.665],[4,50.73],[5,51.902],[6,52.045],[7,52.175],[8,52.306],[9,52.358]]},{"speaker":"tomasz","en":"So can we agree that after eleven, the flat is quiet?","vi":"Vậy mình thống nhất là sau mười một giờ, cả nhà giữ yên lặng nhé?","ipa":["soʊ","kæn","wi","əˈɡɹi","ðæt","ˈæftɚ","ɪˈlɛvən","ðə","flæt","ɪz","ˈkwaɪət"],"start":53.514,"end":56.704,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,53.514],[1,53.7],[2,53.882],[3,54.025],[4,54.39],[5,54.559],[6,54.858],[7,55.535],[8,55.653],[9,56.017],[10,56.16]]},{"speaker":"jade","en":"Agreed. Hana will be very happy.","vi":"Đồng ý. Hana sẽ vui lắm đây.","ipa":["əˈɡɹid","ˈhænə","wɪl","bi","ˈvɛɹi","ˈhæpi"],"start":57.494,"end":59.894,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,57.494],[1,58.429],[2,58.689],[3,58.845],[4,59.002],[5,59.327]]},{"speaker":"kwame","en":"One last thing. Who's been drinking my milk?","vi":"Còn một chuyện cuối. Ai hay uống sữa của tớ vậy?","ipa":["wʌn","læst","θɪŋ","huz","bɪn","ˈdɹɪŋkɪŋ","maɪ","mɪlk"],"start":60.684,"end":62.924,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,60.684],[1,60.801],[2,61.088],[3,61.752],[4,61.895],[5,62.025],[6,62.403],[7,62.52]]},{"speaker":"tomasz","en":"Ah… What if we bought milk from a shared fund? Starting tomorrow?","vi":"À… Hay là mình mua sữa bằng quỹ chung? Bắt đầu từ mai nhé?","ipa":["ɑ","wʌt","ɪf","wi","bɑt","mɪlk","fɹʌm","ə","ʃɛɹd","fʌnd","ˈstɑɹtɪŋ","təˈmɑˌɹoʊ"],"start":63.714,"end":69.114,"expression":"shy","react":{"jade":"happy","kwame":"surprised"},"timing":[[0,63.714],[1,64.953],[2,65.188],[3,65.305],[4,65.435],[5,65.721],[6,66.047],[7,66.203],[8,66.255],[9,66.646],[10,68.039],[11,68.547]]}],"words":[{"id":"fair","en":"fair","ipa":"fɛɹ","vi":"công bằng; hội chợ; khá","level":0},{"id":"agree","en":"agree","ipa":"əˈɡɹi","vi":"đồng ý; nhất trí; tán thành","level":0},{"id":"compromise","en":"compromise","ipa":"ˈkɑmpɹəˌmaɪz","vi":"sự thỏa hiệp; thỏa hiệp; làm tổn hại","level":2},{"id":"noise","en":"noise","ipa":"nɔɪz","vi":"tiếng ồn; tạp âm","level":0},{"id":"mind","en":"mind","ipa":"maɪnd","vi":"tâm trí; trí óc; thấy phiền","level":0},{"id":"awkward","en":"awkward","ipa":"ˈɑkwɚd","vi":"lúng túng; ngượng nghịu; khó xử; vụng về","level":2}],"focus":{"title":"Thương lượng và thoả hiệp","pattern":"How about if we…? · Would you mind (+V-ing)…? · That sounds fair. · I can live with that. · Can we agree that…? · What if…?","explain":"Đề nghị mềm mỏng: \"How about if we…?\", \"What if we…?\". Nhờ vả lịch sự: \"Would you mind + V-ing?\" (trả lời đồng ý: \"No, not at all\"). Chấp nhận thoả hiệp: \"That sounds fair\", \"I can live with that\". Chốt lại: \"Can we agree that…?\".","keys":["how about if we","would you mind","that sounds fair","i can live with that","can we agree that","what if"],"lines":[3,4,6,7,14,17]},"audio":{"src":"/audio/library/videos/vd-b1-the-flat-share.mp3","v":"c9b58a0204","duration":70.2,"fps":25,"mouth":""}}